<title>MEXICO: Mexico probes alleged Russia, Ukraine steel dumping.</title>
<headline>Mexico probes alleged Russia, Ukraine steel dumping.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico said on Tuesday it was investigating reports that Russia and the Ukraine have been dumping steel plate on the Mexican market.</p>
<p>Mexico's Ministry of Trade said the investigation was being undertaken at the request of the national steel industry.</p>
<p>&quot;There are indications that between the May and December 1996, there was an increase in imports of steel plate from Russia and Ukraine at dumping prices, which damanged national producers,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Interested parties have 30 days from Wednesday to present proof and arguments before a preliminary decision is made. ((--Cecilia Cardenas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9552))</p>
